  "comments": "Varieties are known.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Obverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span> - wide epaulette, convex medals, signature FR. Thenot under the sash of the Legion of Merit of Chile.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span> - R very close to epaulette, no signature under the sash.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3</span> - wide epaulette, medals almost incused, script bold, signature under the sash.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">4</span> - wide epaulette, convex medals, script bold, signature under the sash.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">5</span> - small portrait, narrow epaulette and the sash, medals stylized, no signature under the sash.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">6</span> - small portrait, narrow epaulette and the sash, medals stylized, no signature under the sash, tall script to LIBERTADOR B.O&#039;HIGGINS.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Note</span>. Additional features of haircut shown on images. Picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/619a2224e6f88.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/619a2224e6f88.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"236\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Reverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> - date vertically aligned.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> - date lower.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">C</span> - squat script to PESOS and date.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">D</span> - date higher.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">E</span>- date higher, PESOS bold.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">F</span> - date lower, PESOS bold.<br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/619a228864db0.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/619a228864db0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"111\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Combinations</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>: 1992.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>: 1993-1999, 2002 A, 2002 So.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">D</span>: 2006-2009.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">C</span>: 2001 SA.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>: 2000, 2001 So, 2003.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">D</span>: 2004.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">4</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">D</span>: 2005, 2007.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">5</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>: 2015.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">5</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">E</span>: 2011-2013.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">5</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">F</span>: 2014.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">6</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>: 2015.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Note</span>. There is tiny difference in thickness of PESOS in 2002.<br /><br />\r\n2000-2003:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5ae67cca3db90.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5ae67cca3db90.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"130\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2001:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/56c34f01c9fc0.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/56c34f01c9fc0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2002:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/56c34f13d8d07.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/56c34f13d8d07.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2004-2005:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5ae67cd27d19e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5ae67cd27d19e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"129\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2007:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5ae67cdc4ff35.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5ae67cdc4ff35.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"123\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2009:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59e6f45f7761b.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59e6f45f7761b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"126\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2011:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59e6f60cce48a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59e6f60cce48a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"88\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2015:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59e6f1d6f1b93.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59e6f1d6f1b93.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"112\" /></a>",
